    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35581" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνθεσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐντίθημι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>putting in, insertion,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ νῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Cra.</u>
					426c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴδους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					5.9.3
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				4.20
			</span></i>; <i>putting into the mouth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς τροφῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					1.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>that which is put in the mouth, mouthful,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				404
			</span></i> (troch.), <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				108.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Telecl.
				1.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hermipp.
				41
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>grafting, graft,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.301
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				10.37.1
			</span></i>.</div>
